            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Logical Pauli Z expectation values for for the GKP circuit as a function of the GKP squeezing parameter <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex> for different values of the loss channel transmissivity <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\eta||)</marimo-tex>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The errors in the absence of losses are due to the finite squeezing of the finite GKP states.</span></span>"
